message: "If you use or reference this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Huiran-cerebro (赛博大脑) — 个人/团队记忆中枢与知识库引擎"
abstract: >-
  A single-file SQLite memory and knowledge engine for AI agents and personal
  knowledge management. Combines a RAG knowledge base, typed memory fragments,
  an entity relationship graph, and RRF-based hybrid retrieval (FTS5 BM25 +
  LIKE + entity + local semantic vectors) in one dependency-free file.
  Ships a Flask web UI and a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server.
